      <div class="dr-field">
        <label for="dr-src">源文件夹（坏盘上的目录）</label>
        <div class="dr-path">
          <input type="text" id="dr-src" name="src" value="<?=dr_h($cfg['src'])?>" placeholder="/mnt/disk1/downloads/example" spellcheck="false" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          <button type="button" class="dr-btn dr-btn-icon" data-browse="dr-src" title="浏览" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>…</button>
        </div>
        <div class="dr-hint">可以输入磁盘路径 <code>/mnt/disk1/...</code>，也可以输入共享路径 <code>/mnt/user/...</code>。
          怀疑某块盘有问题时，优先使用 <code>/mnt/diskX</code>，避免经过 shfs/FUSE 层。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="dr-field">
        <label for="dr-dst">目标文件夹（健康磁盘上的目录）</label>
        <div class="dr-path">
          <input type="text" id="dr-dst" name="dst" value="<?=dr_h($cfg['dst'])?>" placeholder="/mnt/disk4/downloads/example" spellcheck="false" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          <button type="button" class="dr-btn dr-btn-icon" data-browse="dr-dst" title="浏览" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>…</button>
        </div>
        <div class="dr-hint">目标目录必须已存在，且不能位于源目录内部。请预留足够的剩余空间。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dr-quick" id="dr-quick">
      <?php foreach ($disks as $d): ?>
        <button type="button" class="dr-chip" data-path="<?=dr_h($d['path'])?>" title="<?=dr_h($d['path'])?>（可用 <?=dr_h(dr_mb($d['avail']))?>）">
          <?=dr_h($d['label'])?><small><?=dr_h($d['name'])?></small>
        </button>
      <?php endforeach; ?>
    </div>

    <details class="dr-advanced" <?=$running ? 'open' : ''?>>
      <summary>速度监控与高级选项</summary>

      <div class="dr-grid3">
        <div class="dr-field">
          <label for="dr-min-speed">最低平均速度（MB/s）</label>
          <input type="number" id="dr-min-speed" name="min_speed" min="0" max="10240" step="1"
                 value="<?=dr_h($cfg['min_speed'])?>" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          <div class="dr-hint">统计窗口内的平均速度低于此值就判定卡死。0 = 关闭速度监控。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dr-field">
          <label for="dr-speed-window">统计窗口（秒）</label>
          <input type="number" id="dr-speed-window" name="speed_window" min="2" max="3600" step="1"
                 value="<?=dr_h($cfg['speed_window'])?>" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          <div class="dr-hint">默认 10 秒：最近 10 秒平均速度低于阈值才判定，避免瞬时不稳误判。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dr-field">
          <label for="dr-check">采样间隔（秒）</label>
          <input type="number" id="dr-check" name="check" min="1" max="60" step="1"
                 value="<?=dr_h($cfg['check'])?>" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          <div class="dr-hint">每隔多少秒读一次 dd 已复制的字节数。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dr-field">
          <label for="dr-max-stall">连续判定次数</label>
          <input type="number" id="dr-max-stall" name="max_stall" min="1" max="100" step="1"
                 value="<?=dr_h($cfg['max_stall'])?>" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          <div class="dr-hint" id="dr-stall-hint">最近 10 秒平均速度低于 10MB/s 即跳过。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dr-field">
          <label for="dr-grace-factor">宽限倍数</label>
          <input type="number" id="dr-grace-factor" name="grace_factor" min="0" max="100" step="1"
                 value="<?=dr_h($cfg['grace_factor'])?>" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          <div class="dr-hint">宽限 = 倍数 ×（文件大小 ÷ 阈值速度），期间不判定。0 = 不按大小放宽。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dr-field">
          <label for="dr-grace-max">宽限上限（秒）</label>
          <input type="number" id="dr-grace-max" name="grace_max" min="5" max="86400" step="1"
                 value="<?=dr_h($cfg['grace_max'])?>" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          <div class="dr-hint">超大文件的宽限封顶，默认 900 秒（15 分钟）。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="dr-field">
          <label for="dr-grace-small">小文件宽限（秒）</label>
          <input type="number" id="dr-grace-small" name="grace_small" min="1" max="3600" step="1"
                 value="<?=dr_h($cfg['grace_small'])?>" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          <div class="dr-hint">小于 4MiB 的文件固定用这个宽限，默认 10 秒。</div>
        </div>
