          跳过目标中已存在且大小一致的文件（断点续跑推荐）</label>
        <label class="dr-check"><input type="checkbox" name="sync" value="1" <?=!empty($cfg['sync']) ? 'checked' : ''?> <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          复制时强制落盘（conv=fsync，速度略慢但更真实）</label>
        <label class="dr-check"><input type="checkbox" name="dry_run" value="1" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          仅预扫描：只读检查文件头部，不复制（用于评估坏盘范围）</label>
        <label class="dr-check"><input type="checkbox" name="force" value="1" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>
          忽略“目标剩余空间不足 2GB”的检查（不建议）</label>
      </div>
    </details>

    <div class="dr-actions">
      <button type="button" class="dr-btn dr-btn-primary" id="dr-start" <?=$running ? 'disabled' : ''?>>开始抢救</button>
      <button type="button" class="dr-btn dr-btn-danger" id="dr-stop" <?=$running ? '' : 'disabled'?>>停止</button>
      <span class="dr-note" id="dr-note"></span>
    </div>
  </form>

  <!-- ============================ 进度 ============================ -->
  <div class="dr-card" id="dr-progress-card" style="<?=$running || (isset($st['state']) && $st['state'] !== 'idle') ? '' : 'display:none'?>">
    <div class="dr-sec-title"><span class="dr-step">2</span> 运行状态</div>

    <div class="dr-statusline">
      <span class="dr-state" id="dr-state"><?=dr_h(isset($st['state']) ? $st['state'] : 'idle')?></span>
      <span class="dr-detail" id="dr-detail"><?=dr_h(isset($st['detail']) ? $st['detail'] : '')?></span>
      <span class="dr-spacer"></span>
      <span class="dr-kv">当前速度 <b id="dr-speed">—</b></span>
      <span class="dr-kv">平均速度 <b id="dr-avg">—</b></span>
      <span class="dr-kv">已用时间 <b id="dr-elapsed">—</b></span>
    </div>

    <div class="dr-phasebar" id="dr-phasebar">
      <?php foreach ([1 => '检查', 2 => '建目录', 3 => '枚举', 4 => '复制', 6 => '完成'] as $i => $label): ?>
        <div class="dr-phase<?=$i <= $curPhase ? ' on' : ''?><?=$i === $curPhase ? ' cur' : ''?>" data-phase="<?=$i?>">
          <span class="dr-dot"></span><?=$label?>
        </div>
      <?php endforeach; ?>
    </div>

    <div class="dr-progress"><div class="dr-bar" id="dr-bar" style="width:0%"></div></div>
    <div class="dr-progressline">
      <span id="dr-counts">文件 0 / 0</span>
      <span id="dr-curfile" class="dr-curfile"></span>
      <span id="dr-bytes" class="dr-right">已复制 0 B</span>
    </div>
    <div class="dr-counters">
      <span class="dr-ok">成功 <b id="dr-ok">0</b></span>
      <span class="dr-skip">跳过 <b id="dr-skip">0</b></span>
      <span class="dr-fail">失败 <b id="dr-fail">0</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================ 日志 ============================ -->
  <div class="dr-card" id="dr-log-card">
    <div class="dr-sec-title">
      <span class="dr-step">3</span> 实时日志
      <span class="dr-spacer"></span>
      <label class="dr-check dr-inline"><input type="checkbox" id="dr-autoscroll" checked> 自动滚动</label>
      <button type="button" class="dr-btn dr-btn-ghost dr-btn-sm" id="dr-log-clear">清屏</button>
    </div>
    <pre class="dr-log" id="dr-log">等待任务开始…</pre>
  </div>

  <div class="dr-card dr-help">
    <div class="dr-sec-title">使用建议</div>
    <ol>
      <li><b>先预扫描</b>：勾选“仅预扫描”跑一遍，确认坏道大致集中在哪里，再决定复制策略。</li>
      <li><b>目标不要用缓存盘/共享盘</b>：优先选一块容量充足、健康的磁盘（如 <code>/mnt/disk4</code>），减少中间层干扰。</li>
      <li><b>失败文件</b>会记录到目标目录的 <code>disk-rescue-failed.txt</code>；被中断的文件保留为 <code>*.partial</code>，之后可用 <code>ddrescue</code> 补读。</li>
      <li><b>不要在抢救过程中重启或停止阵列</b>；如需中断，点“停止”即可安全收尾。</li>
      <li>日志与最近状态保存在 <code>/boot/config/plugins/diskrescue/</code>，重启后仍可查看最后一次运行结果。</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>

